<Example Source="SliderVertical.razor"><SliderVertical /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Controlled</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    shadcn holds the value in a state variable and prints it beside the label. There is no state
    here, so the printing is the browser's: an <code>&lt;output for&gt;</code>, which is the
    element built for exactly this.
</p>
